 "summary": "Proofs are robust (field_simp/ring/push_cast/norm_num/fun_prop rather than named-lemma chains), free of `change` and of goal-manipulating `show` \u2014 the only `show`s are `rw [show a = b by ring]` rewrites \u2014 and the substantial shared reasoning is factored into `integral_cubic_mul_rpow`, `plusFunctional_of_intervalIntegrable`, `plusOneMinus_id_mul` and `intervalIntegrable_of_plusOneMinus_integrand`. Cross-file proofs go through the `pair_def`/`moment_def` unfolding lemmas rather than definitional equality, no proof exceeds 50 lines, and I found no redundant hypotheses or unfolding-heavy `simpa`.",
